        "## 10. Análise de Sensibilidade do Threshold\n",
        "\n",
        "A construção da rede depende diretamente do valor do threshold utilizado.\n",
        "\n",
        "Para investigar esse impacto, diferentes valores de threshold são avaliados.\n",
        "\n",
        "Para cada valor:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. A rede é reconstruída;\n",
        "2. A centralidade é calculada;\n",
        "3. Os 10 atributos mais relevantes são selecionados;\n",
        "4. Um novo classificador SVM é treinado;\n",
        "5. A acurácia é registrada.\n",
        "\n",
        "O objetivo é analisar como mudanças na estrutura da rede influenciam o desempenho do modelo."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Yf-jWHq3i6X1"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "thresholds = [0.4, 0.5, 0.6, 0.7, 0.8]\n",
        "\n",
        "resultados_threshold = []\n",
        "\n",
        "for threshold in thresholds:\n",
        "\n",
        "    G_temp = nx.Graph()\n",
        "\n",
        "    for coluna in X.columns:\n",
        "        G_temp.add_node(coluna)\n",
        "\n",
        "    for i in range(len(corr.columns)):\n",
        "        for j in range(i + 1, len(corr.columns)):\n",
        "\n",
        "            valor = abs(corr.iloc[i, j])\n",
        "\n",
        "            if valor >= threshold:\n",
        "                G_temp.add_edge(\n",
        "                    corr.columns[i],\n",
        "                    corr.columns[j],\n",
        "                    weight=valor\n",
        "                )\n",
        "\n",
        "    degree = nx.degree_centrality(G_temp)\n",
        "\n",
        "    degree_df = pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "        'atributo': degree.keys(),\n",
        "        'centralidade': degree.values()\n",
        "    })\n",
        "\n",
        "    degree_df = degree_df.sort_values(\n",
        "        by='centralidade',\n",
        "        ascending=False\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    top10 = degree_df['atributo'].head(10).tolist()\n",
        "\n",
        "    X_sel = X[top10]\n",
        "\n",
        "    X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(\n",
        "        X_sel,\n",
        "        y,\n",
        "        test_size=0.3,\n",
        "        random_state=42,\n",
        "        stratify=y\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    scaler = StandardScaler()\n",
        "\n",
        "    X_train_scaled = scaler.fit_transform(X_train)\n",
        "    X_test_scaled = scaler.transform(X_test)\n",
        "\n",
        "    svm = SVC()\n",
        "\n",
        "    svm.fit(X_train_scaled, y_train)\n",
        "\n",
        "    pred = svm.predict(X_test_scaled)\n",
        "\n",
        "    acc = accuracy_score(y_test, pred)\n",
        "\n",
        "    resultados_threshold.append([\n",
        "        threshold,\n",
        "        G_temp.number_of_edges(),\n",
        "        acc\n",
        "    ])\n",
